            # apart until working agents read as idle for days.
            #
            # NOT shown, deliberately: planned work / sequencing. Nothing in
            # the system records intent today (4 TodoWrite calls fleet-wide on
            # 2026-07-21, and ~/.claude/todos is empty), so such a column would
            # render empty forever — a panel that looks informative and isn't.
